      "created_at": "2017-03-30T12:55:53Z",
      "updated_at": "2017-03-30T12:56:59Z",
      "body": "With all respect to the developpers for listening to feature requests as well to the users for their ideas:\r\n\r\nLesspass is a **stateless** open source password manager.\r\n\r\nThere are countless software solutions that save whatever information is wanted/needed...\r\n\r\nDo we really need Lesspass becoming just another one...???\r\n\r\nLet's keep this awesome idea and project as lean and simple as possible.\r\nLet's not bloat it with more and more \"convenience\" features that counter the original idea of this service!\r\n\r\nJust my opinion of course...",
