      "updated_at": "2017-03-30T12:56:39Z",
      "body": "Hello @guillaumevincent \r\nYes I know it's always tricky when it's usability vs security ^^\r\n\r\nIn passwordmaker you have 3 options (it's what I use for now but I thinking of change it)\r\n- Not remember\r\n- In memory (I think it's more like something in session because when you close the browser it's gone\r\n- On hard drive and in memory\r\n\r\nI know that it's a bad habit to compare two applications but so it can give some ideas.\r\nIf you can implement your idea, I will be happy to test it and discuss how I feel it...",
