      "body": "@SoftwUser I have the same opinion. But I like to challenge ideas. We discuss new features. \r\nDo not hesitate to put a little reaction like 😕 if the idea does not please you.\r\n\r\nFrom the beginning, LessPass is driven by the community\r\n\r\n@kidburglar did you look at the last Lastpass breaches, where google engineer read some data from memory. It's really hard to mix security versus usability.\r\n\r\n",
