      "updated_at": "2017-04-03T08:04:12Z",
      "body": "Hello,\r\nafter a discussion with @edouard-lopez we are not going to offer a way to save master password.\r\nAll the security of current passwords and future passwords is based on this master password.\r\n\r\nWe will work hard to help the user and fill in more fields automatically.\r\n\r\nI close this one",
